    "totals": "For each player, sum all entered round scores. total[player] = SUM(round_scores for that player)",
    "standings": "Sort players ascending by total (lowest total = rank 1). Ties are not specially handled (natural sort order).",
    "settlement_matrix": "matrix[player_i][player_j] = total[player_i] - total[player_j]. Diagonal is always 0. A positive value means player_i's total exceeds player_j's by that amount; a negative value means the reverse."
